#7900
Outside Redferne's Residence~
   You stand on the flat stone top of an old bastion tower, high above the
roofs of the Lower Ward. A low parapet runs round the edge, and the fog and
chimney smoke of the ward drift past below. Before you to the north stands
Redferne's house, grey and narrow and plain, with a great arched gate of
iron. The ladder and its chain go down over the parapet.
~
