#7902
Redferne's Library~
   Books and scrolls fill every shelf of this room: drill manuals, campaign
rolls, lives of the old captains, prayers. A large globe stands in the dim
north-west corner. Two worn leather armchairs and a great oak desk fill the
middle of the room, under a crystal chandelier. A tall window is set in the
west wall. The yellow door is east.
