#7903
The Reliquary~
   A cold, dark room that faint light seeps into from nowhere. Here Redferne
keeps what he carried back from the west and would not let anyone else keep:
a broken standard, a grey stone that hums, a pair of small shoes. There is
no furniture at all. The only way out is west, back through the low steel
door of the safe.
~
