#7905
The Sitting Room~
   A small, warm sitting room. Its walls are hung with portraits of the old
captains of the wall, stern men and women in plate, every one of them dead.
Pride of place goes to a portrait of a young knight in shining armour. An
old armchair stands by the wall. The only exit is the aspen-wood door to the
east.
